# ==========================================
# Nix / direnv
# ==========================================

# The direnv cache. Regenerated by `direnv allow`; it holds symlinks into the
# nix store and a profile path named for this machine, so it is local state
# rather than anything to share. Its absence is not a broken checkout.
.direnv/
